## Verify before calling a screen done

Do not trust the desktop preview. Run this loop:

1. Open Chrome DevTools device mode at 380x800, iPhone SE profile
2. Screenshot it
3. Look at the screenshot and answer: what is the first thing the eye lands on? Is that the right thing?
4. Test on a real phone over local network before considering the phase complete
